{"spec": "v1", "title": "2025 湖北卷 14：两侧磁场 B 与 2B，周期性运动", "stem": "如图所示，两平行虚线 MN、PQ 间无磁场。MN 左侧区域和 PQ 右侧区域内均有垂直于纸面向外的匀强磁场，磁感应强度大小分别为 B 和 2B。一质量为 m、电荷量为 q 的带正电粒子从 MN 左侧 O 点以大小为 v₀ 的初速度射出，方向平行于 MN 向上。已知 O 点到 MN 的距离为 3mv₀/(2qB)，粒子能回到 O 点，并在纸面内做周期性运动。不计重力。", "params": {"B": [1, "T", "题给 B"], "m": [1, "kg", "题给 m"], "q": [1, "C", "题给 q"], "v0": [1, "m/s", "题给 v₀"], "w": [0.75, "m", "MN、PQ 间距，由“回到 O”决定"]}, "scene": {"surfaces": [], "bodies": [], "particle": {"duration": "5*pi/3+sqrt(3)", "fields": [{"id": "左", "kind": "B", "B": "B", "region": {"x": [-30, 0], "y": [-30, 30]}}, {"id": "右", "kind": "B", "B": "2*B", "region": {"x": ["w", 30], "y": [-30, 30]}}], "particles": [{"id": "p", "q": "q", "m": "m", "pos": ["-3*m*v0/(2*q*B)", 0], "vel": [0, "v0"]}], "view": [-3, -2, 2, 2]}, "notes": [{"text": "M", "line": [[0, -1.8], [0, 1.8]]}, {"text": "P", "line": [["w", -1.8], ["w", 1.8]]}, {"text": "O", "at": ["-3*m*v0/(2*q*B)", 0]}]}, "asks": [{"id": "1", "text": "粒子在 MN 左侧区域中运动轨迹的半径", "expr": "val(r_p)", "at": {"event": "start"}, "answer": 1, "unit": "m", "answerText": "$R=\\dfrac{mv_0}{qB}$"}, {"id": "2", "text": "粒子第一次和第二次经过 PQ 时位置的间距", "expr": "ya-val(y_p)", "at": {"event": "mark", "name": "p离开右"}, "vals": {"ya": {"at": {"event": "mark", "name": "p进入右"}, "expr": "val(y_p)"}}, "answer": "sqrt(3)/2", "unit": "m", "answerText": "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt3mv_0}{2qB}$"}, {"id": "3", "text": "粒子的运动周期", "expr": "val(x_p)", "answer": -1.5, "unit": "", "answerText": "$T=\\dfrac{5\\pi m}{3qB}+\\dfrac{\\sqrt3m}{qB}$"}], "idea": "画好几何：圆心到 MN 的距离决定穿出角度，这个角度在无场区不变，再决定右边圆弧的圆心角。", "solution": {"1": [{"say": "洛伦兹力提供向心力。", "tex": "qv_0B=\\dfrac{mv_0^2}{R}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ R=\\dfrac{mv_0}{qB}"}], "2": [{"say": "$O$ 到 $MN$ 的距离是 $\\dfrac32R$，圆心到 $MN$ 距离 $\\dfrac R2$，穿过 $MN$ 时速度与 $MN$ 成 60°。", "tex": "\\cos\\theta=\\dfrac{R/2}{R}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\theta=60^\\circ", "at": {"event": "mark", "name": "p离开左"}}, {"say": "右侧磁场是 $2B$，半径减半。", "tex": "R'=\\dfrac R2", "at": {"event": "mark", "name": "p进入右"}}, {"say": "两次经过 $PQ$ 的位置是一条弦。", "tex": "\\Delta x=2R'\\sin60^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3mv_0}{2qB}", "at": {"event": "mark", "name": "p离开右"}}], "3": [{"say": "左侧圆弧圆心角 240°。", "tex": "t_1=\\dfrac23\\cdot\\dfrac{2\\pi m}{qB}=\\dfrac{4\\pi m}{3qB}", "at": {"event": "mark", "name": "p离开左"}}, {"say": "右侧圆弧圆心角 120°。", "tex": "t_2=\\dfrac13\\cdot\\dfrac{2\\pi m}{2qB}=\\dfrac{\\pi m}{3qB}", "at": {"event": "mark", "name": "p离开右"}}, {"say": "两段直线的时间由“回到 $O$”的几何关系定。", "tex": "t_3=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3m}{qB}", "at": {"event": "mark", "name": "p进入左"}}, {"say": "一个周期就是这几段相加。", "tex": "T=\\dfrac{5\\pi m}{3qB}+\\dfrac{\\sqrt3m}{qB}"}]}}